## Goal
Show how the treated and untreated samples separate on a principal component analysis of the
gene-level counts. The six rnaseq_bulk samples (untreated A1-A3, treated B1-B3) are projected
onto their first principal components and plotted coloured by condition. The analysis reports
the projection and the variance each component explains; it does not test for differential
expression.

